<title>PHILIPPINES: SM Prime to build 20-ha shopping mall.</title>
<headline>SM Prime to build 20-ha shopping mall.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>SM Prime Holdings said on Wednesday it would build a 20-hectare shopping complex on the Manila Bay reclamation area within the next three years.</p>
<p>SM Prime chairman Henry Sy said the development would cost 4.5 billion pesos. Sy announced the plan during the launching of a campaign to position the Philippines as Asia's next shopping capital.</p>
<p>The mall will have a total leasable floor area of 500,000 square metres.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
